rra consolidated Democratic support following Eric Swalwell’s withdrawal and secured endorsements from Governor Gavin Newsom and other party figures. California’s heavily Democratic electorate and consistent double-digit polling leads have produced the current trader consensus reflected in market prices, with Hilton trailing significantly despite some narrowing in one recent survey. The November 3 general election outcome could shift only in the event of major late developments such as turnout surprises or unforeseen events affecting either candidate.","context_requires_regen":false,"context_updated_at":"2026-08-30T00:01:26.604Z"},"version":"v1"}
